{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜神二十四乘組準備執行升空任務／兩電明年加電費\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-CN-SENDOFF-261125A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月25日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【飛行乘組出征】神二十四飛行乘組在酒泉衛星發射中心出征，準備執行升空任務。</p><p>【兩電明年加價】兩電出年加電費，中電加1.8%，港燈加7.9%。</p><p>【病人資料外洩】港怡醫院手機應用程式疑遭入侵，病人資料外洩。醫衞局暫時吊銷港怡的醫健通登記。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.726100+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:03:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:15.631087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:48.862792+00:00","content_hash":"7ff33cf4823367d05e8644e5aca6aea52204b002f48788ae133a83484101fb95","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.726100+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}